Chromium vector icons
======================

The `.icon` files in this directory (except `maximize.icon`) are copied from the
Chromium source tree:

- `components/vector_icons/`
- `chrome/app/vector_icons/`

Copyright 2012-2026 The Chromium Authors. Use of this source code is governed
by a BSD-style license that can be found at
https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/LICENSE (BSD 3-Clause).

They are stored as the original path text and rasterized by `src/icons.rs`.
No Google or Chrome logos, wordmarks, or product images are included.

`maximize.icon` is a geometric window glyph written for Mithu. It is not a
Chromium asset.
